       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DRVPARM.
      * LOCAL TEST DRIVER - PLAYS THE JCL EXEC PARM: BUILDS THE MVS
      * PARAMETER AREA (HALFWORD LENGTH + TEXT) FROM THE COMMAND LINE
      * "PROGRAM PARMTEXT" (THE TEXT MAY START WITH BLANKS: USE '_' FOR
      * EACH LEADING BLANK), CALLS THE PROGRAM, ENDS WITH ITS RC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CMD                          PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-PGM                          PIC X(08) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-TEXT                         PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-I                            PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       01  PARM-AREA.
           05  PARM-LENGTH                 PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
           05  PARM-TEXT                   PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-CMD FROM COMMAND-LINE
           UNSTRING WS-CMD DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE INTO WS-PGM WS-TEXT
           INSPECT WS-TEXT REPLACING ALL '_' BY SPACE
           MOVE WS-TEXT TO PARM-TEXT
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 80 BY -1
                   UNTIL WS-I < 1 OR WS-TEXT (WS-I:1) NOT = SPACE
           END-PERFORM
           MOVE WS-I TO PARM-LENGTH
           CALL WS-PGM USING PARM-AREA
           DISPLAY 'DRVPARM: ' WS-PGM ' ENDED RC=' RETURN-CODE
           STOP RUN.
